<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tower Automotive.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tower Automotive.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said Tower Automotive Inc's proposed acquisition of A.O. Smith Corp's auto products unit is a &quot;huge plus&quot; for Tower.</p>
<p>-- said deal will dramatically expand Tower's capabilities beyond its traditional product portfolio. The deal will also make the company a &quot;truly global enterprise.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said preliminary analysis of deal suggest earnings per share accretion of about $0.50 for 1997. Set a 1997 earnings estimate of $2.45 a share and a 1998 estimate of $3.05 a share.</p>
<p>-- set a 6-12 month price target of $45 a share.</p>
<p>-- Tower Automotive gained 4-3/8 to 41-5/8.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
